{"author":{"id":"86dc3c885e4fa466d19699d4a5e74c240f1c9d6b23f4e62ea2d2d8e359bd1711"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790530166,"nonce":"VgH2AqQxe6BzllNWYyOhaSiVqZ0=","title":"Let the desktop tutor search enabled examples for inspiration","message":"## What to build\n\nLet the integrated desktop tutor search bundled example sketches for inspiration. Search enabled example titles, categories, tags, and descriptions, and return their GIC source with a small, relevant set of results. Reuse the product content enabled filter so hidden examples cannot appear in results.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- A tutor example lookup finds relevant enabled examples by title, category, tag, or description and includes each match title and .gic source.\n- Disabled examples never appear in results, even when they match a query.\n- Results and returned source are bounded; the full example collection is not inserted into every tutor prompt.\n- The tutor can use examples as inspiration without presenting complete sketches as solutions; language syntax claims still use the language reference.\n- Tests cover search, filtering, returned source, and the desktop tutor tool flow.\n\nThe browser PWA deterministic tutor is outside this feature scope.","files":null}]}